====== TP-Link TL-MR3420 v5======
{{page>meta:infobox:construction&noheader&nofooter&noeditbtn}}

The TP-Link TL-MR3420 v5 is a simple N300 router with 5-port FE switch and non-detachable antennas.

Its very similar to the [[toh:hwdata/tp-link/tp-link_tl-wr841n_v13|TP-Link TL-WR841N v13]] and identical to [[:toh:tp-link:tl-wr842nd|TL-WR842N v5]]

